## Signing / notarization secrets — never commit (see RELEASING.md)
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
# The Sparkle update-signing PRIVATE key. Its public half belongs in Info.plist
# and is committed; this half signs every update every user will ever install,
# so it lives in the keychain and, when exported for backup, never here.
# RELEASING.md tells you to export it — this is the net under that instruction.
*private-key*.txt
sparkle-private-key*
